# macOS Finder metadata. Written on every folder the Finder opens, so it
# reappears constantly and shows up as a modification to a file nobody
# edited. Three of these were tracked before this file existed; they were
# untracked in the same commit, which deletes them from the repo but
# leaves them on disk.
.DS_Store

# Local-only handoff notes. Deliberately untracked: David keeps a local
